WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.988
Now the code.

2
00:00:00.988 --> 00:00:05.553
The collector makes the list call, then
a get for each announcement, because only

3
00:00:05.553 --> 00:00:10.188
the details call names the affected
resources and carries the full description.

4
00:00:10.188 --> 00:00:15.090
The normalizer keeps the latest announcement
in each chain, by its update time,

5
00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:17.201
and gives the record the chain's ID,

6
00:00:17.201 --> 00:00:21.575
so a rescheduled window updates one
notice instead of adding a second.

7
00:00:21.575 --> 00:00:24.128
The summary is the
description from the details,

8
00:00:24.128 --> 00:00:26.490
an inactive announcement
closes the notice,

9
00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:30.620
and the source link is the announcement
on the realm's own Announcements host.
